WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 27]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:01.790 --> 02:02.290
Laogou,

02:02.760 --> 02:03.180
here.

02:07.480 --> 02:07.820
Wait...

02:07.870 --> 02:08.220
Here.

02:09.240 --> 02:09.820
Make do with this.

02:11.710 --> 02:12.130
Here.

02:14.470 --> 02:14.890
Sit down.

02:15.710 --> 02:16.850
You're hurt. Where are you going?

02:17.560 --> 02:18.100
Eat the flatbread.

02:18.800 --> 02:19.380
Well, I...

02:21.000 --> 02:21.500
Laogou,

02:22.680 --> 02:24.290
isn't it a little awkward for me to sit here?

02:25.240 --> 02:26.130
What's awkward about it?

02:27.310 --> 02:27.690
By the way,

02:28.710 --> 02:29.540
how did you get hurt?

02:30.150 --> 02:31.100
How come Master Zhang

02:31.120 --> 02:31.940
didn't get a scratch?

02:32.000 --> 02:32.380
Come on.

02:33.150 --> 02:35.260
Master Zhang has Qiongqi protecting him.

02:35.910 --> 02:37.690
I'm just flesh and blood,

02:38.080 --> 02:39.730
and I can barely fight back.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.260
Someone slashed me right here...

02:42.840 --> 02:43.290
He's back.

02:47.560 --> 02:48.010
Master Zhang,

02:48.750 --> 02:49.220
the medical staff

02:49.240 --> 02:50.100
detained by the Japanese

02:50.190 --> 02:50.980
have all been rescued.

02:51.590 --> 02:52.380
They and Unit 401

02:52.630 --> 02:53.780
have been sent to the hospital.

02:55.280 --> 02:55.820
Good.

02:57.080 --> 02:59.010
Compile everything about the Xumi Realm

02:59.840 --> 03:01.100
and the Japanese military's plan

03:01.400 --> 03:02.340
as soon as possible

03:02.910 --> 03:03.660
and report it to the higher-ups.

03:04.430 --> 03:04.850
Yes, sir.

03:07.630 --> 03:08.260
Stinky Yu.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.130
Stinky Yu, come here.

03:09.430 --> 03:10.010
Give me a hand.

03:11.960 --> 03:12.820
I'm heading back.

03:13.910 --> 03:14.730
Come on. Let's go.

03:47.560 --> 03:48.170
At long last,

03:49.430 --> 03:50.500
this whole mess

03:51.030 --> 03:51.940
is over.

03:54.150 --> 03:54.940
Anyway,

03:56.190 --> 03:56.780
I did find

03:57.750 --> 03:58.780
your men for you.

04:00.280 --> 04:00.730
Thank you.

04:02.960 --> 04:03.820
In that case,

04:05.150 --> 04:06.130
I'll keep my promise

04:06.800 --> 04:07.410
and leave the Mystic Nine.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.450
We're brothers.

04:13.030 --> 04:14.570
What I said back then was only a joke.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.220
Why take it seriously?

04:19.000 --> 04:20.140
The misunderstanding between us

04:21.630 --> 04:22.610
is cleared up now.

04:23.750 --> 04:24.810
You don't have to leave

04:26.000 --> 04:26.580
the Mystic Nine.

04:28.160 --> 04:28.810
A joke?

04:30.430 --> 04:32.460
You forced Tiezui to swear

04:33.190 --> 04:34.370
a deadly oath

04:34.430 --> 04:35.290
on his own family line.

04:36.160 --> 04:37.050
If Tiezui really ends up

04:37.070 --> 04:38.250
with no descendants,

04:39.310 --> 04:41.370
you might be cut to pieces.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.930
Back then...

04:48.560 --> 04:50.050
Back then, I only said what would happen

04:50.070 --> 04:51.170
if you and Tiezui

04:51.190 --> 04:52.410
broke your oath, not me.

04:52.800 --> 04:54.250
Now I'm the one breaking my word.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.340
Whatever the consequences,

04:56.160 --> 04:56.900
I'll bear them.

04:58.190 --> 04:59.370
Then the head of the Mystic Nine...

05:01.950 --> 05:03.050
It has to be you, of course.

05:03.120 --> 05:04.100
Who else could it be?

05:11.160 --> 05:12.100
After everything we've been through,

05:13.070 --> 05:14.700
with the Ministry of War, the Mystic Nine,

05:15.000 --> 05:15.900
and the Japanese,

05:17.390 --> 05:18.490
I understand now.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.050
Your burden is heavier than any of ours.

05:22.070 --> 05:23.100
Protecting the Mystic Nine is hard.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.220
Protecting Changsha

05:26.310 --> 05:26.810
is even harder.

05:27.560 --> 05:28.220
But, Master Zhang,

05:30.800 --> 05:31.370
you did it.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.540
I didn't do it alone.

05:35.800 --> 05:36.850
We did it together.

05:39.720 --> 05:41.250
No matter what storms come our way,

05:42.390 --> 05:43.250
the Mystic Nine will stand united

05:43.720 --> 05:44.660
as long as the Xiang River flows.

05:46.830 --> 05:47.290
Yes.

06:00.220 --> 06:03.620
[Changsha Garrison Command]

06:13.430 --> 06:14.010
Officer Luo,

06:14.590 --> 06:16.340
I'm honored that you called me personally.

06:17.120 --> 06:17.820
Wenhai,

06:18.990 --> 06:20.850
I hear you've been doing quite well

06:20.870 --> 06:21.730
in Changsha.

06:22.400 --> 06:23.850
The higher-ups think highly of you.

06:25.310 --> 06:26.660
What are you working on lately?

06:27.550 --> 06:28.250
You're too kind, sir.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.010
I'm only following orders.

06:30.450 --> 06:32.250
I've been ordered to purge

06:32.750 --> 06:34.410
the Mystic Nine from Changsha.

06:34.840 --> 06:36.380
The Mystic Nine have long been entrenched here,

06:36.400 --> 06:37.250
with ties running deep.

06:37.550 --> 06:38.730
I'm trying to devise a sound plan

06:38.920 --> 06:40.450
that will keep Changsha stable

06:40.710 --> 06:41.730
while also completing the task

06:41.750 --> 06:42.940
from our superiors as soon as possible.

06:45.310 --> 06:45.820
Sir,

06:47.520 --> 06:49.450
may I ask for your guidance?

06:50.920 --> 06:51.970
With your wisdom and experience,

06:52.310 --> 06:53.450
perhaps you can help me

06:54.400 --> 06:55.220
clear up my doubts.

06:57.840 --> 06:58.850
In my courtyard,

06:59.200 --> 07:00.220
there's a Buddhist pine

07:01.270 --> 07:02.380
with deep roots and lush foliage.

07:03.920 --> 07:05.850
Pruning a tree is an art.

07:06.520 --> 07:08.130
Cut too much, and you damage the roots.

07:08.360 --> 07:10.900
Cut too little, and pests take hold.

07:12.960 --> 07:14.940
But if you try to uproot it,

07:15.120 --> 07:15.940
you'll find

07:16.240 --> 07:17.620
its roots have long become entwined

07:17.640 --> 07:18.530
with the house and walls.

07:19.030 --> 07:20.100
If you truly pull it out,

07:20.640 --> 07:21.850
the whole house

07:23.270 --> 07:24.290
could come down with it.

07:28.520 --> 07:29.290
I understand.

07:30.640 --> 07:31.500
So,

07:32.150 --> 07:33.130
pruning a tree

07:33.800 --> 07:35.820
doesn't always mean uprooting it.

07:37.400 --> 07:38.250
I'll remember that.

07:38.310 --> 07:39.620
Thank you for your guidance, sir.

07:50.680 --> 07:51.290
Come in.

07:53.430 --> 07:53.940
Sir,

07:54.150 --> 07:54.940
do we move now?

07:56.710 --> 07:58.530
The arrow is already on the string.

08:00.400 --> 08:01.660
But no one is to be killed.

08:02.470 --> 08:03.290
Find a few charges

08:03.310 --> 08:04.130
and lock them up.

08:45.560 --> 08:47.010
I've long heard of the Xiangxi assassins.

08:47.670 --> 08:48.330
They say you

08:48.350 --> 08:49.820
specialize in solving difficult problems.

08:50.560 --> 08:51.940
I happen to have one

08:52.440 --> 08:53.860
I'd like your help with.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.890
I want the heads of the Mystic Nine's clan leaders.

09:04.200 --> 09:04.940
This is the deposit.

09:05.760 --> 09:06.620
Once it's done,

09:07.030 --> 09:07.940
I'll pay you ten times as much.

09:09.000 --> 09:09.940
In three days,

09:10.710 --> 09:11.650
you'll have their heads.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.940
Can you really

09:13.960 --> 09:15.180
kill the Mystic Nine?

09:16.080 --> 09:18.300
We come from the same clan as Zhang Qishan.

09:18.670 --> 09:19.690
We can do

09:21.110 --> 09:22.500
whatever he can.

09:25.150 --> 09:27.090
Why come to us only now?

09:27.670 --> 09:29.300
My superiors had other plans before.

09:30.590 --> 09:32.690
Now I'm fully in charge.

09:32.760 --> 09:33.980
If you change your mind,

09:34.500 --> 09:37.590
[Heixiao, leader of the Xiangxi assassins]

09:37.590 --> 09:38.770
the deposit is nonrefundable.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.860
Eryue Hong has a secret chamber.

09:44.910 --> 09:46.450
Very few people in this world know

09:46.560 --> 09:47.860
how to get inside.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.570
And I've heard

09:50.080 --> 09:51.180
even explosives

09:51.270 --> 09:52.500
can't breach it.

09:53.710 --> 09:55.330
Since the city was sealed, he's been hiding there

09:55.590 --> 09:56.690
and hasn't shown himself once.

09:56.960 --> 10:09.740
♪The moon-worship hall stands empty as clouds mass across the night sky♪

10:11.470 --> 10:12.690
Eryue Hong's weakness

10:13.000 --> 10:14.090
is his late wife.

10:15.110 --> 10:16.300
Make good use of that.

10:17.230 --> 10:18.010
Though Chen Pi

10:18.030 --> 10:19.010
is Eryue Hong's disciple,

10:19.790 --> 10:21.210
he resents Eryue Hong

10:21.640 --> 10:23.060
because he believes Eryue Hong

10:23.270 --> 10:24.300
caused the death of the woman

10:24.320 --> 10:26.250
he cared about most, Eryue Hong's wife.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.380
I've heard Chen Pi

10:28.440 --> 10:29.090
has entered

10:29.110 --> 10:30.940
Eryue Hong's secret chamber many times to kill him.

10:31.960 --> 10:33.250
So Chen Pi must know

10:33.670 --> 10:35.060
how to get inside.

10:57.150 --> 10:59.090
Not nearly as good as what Madam made.

11:21.470 --> 11:23.130
My memory isn't very good.

11:23.470 --> 11:24.890
I've stepped on countless ants,

11:26.640 --> 11:28.420
but why don't I remember

11:30.200 --> 11:32.090
ever killing anyone in Xiangxi?

11:35.200 --> 11:36.090
Today,

11:37.440 --> 11:39.250
I'll give you something to remember.

12:11.880 --> 12:13.210
Do you recognize

12:15.200 --> 12:17.250
your master's wife's coffin?

12:20.790 --> 12:21.690
As long as you...

12:21.840 --> 12:22.940
You have a death wish!

13:05.390 --> 13:05.900
Madam.

13:06.160 --> 13:07.730
Madam...

13:37.870 --> 13:38.370
Is he dead?

13:39.440 --> 13:41.450
He was hit by a Xiangxi poison needle.

13:42.630 --> 13:43.570
If you want him dead,

13:44.160 --> 13:45.260
throw him into filthy water,

13:45.280 --> 13:46.570
and he'll rot away at once.

13:47.800 --> 13:48.900
If you want him alive,

13:50.470 --> 13:51.450
here's the antidote.

13:52.510 --> 13:53.540
You decide.

13:54.710 --> 13:55.780
I need him alive

13:56.110 --> 13:57.060
to find Eryue Hong.

14:23.750 --> 14:24.940
Anyone who dares move against the Mystic Nine

14:24.960 --> 14:26.300
must have someone powerful behind them.

14:27.160 --> 14:28.610
Does the recent lockdown of Changsha

14:29.350 --> 14:30.940
have anything to do with this?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.020
Is the Ministry of War behind it?

14:36.160 --> 14:37.450
No need to probe.

14:38.560 --> 14:40.820
Officer Luo knows how formidable the Zhang Clan is

14:41.510 --> 14:43.090
and has been searching everywhere for its members.

14:43.990 --> 14:45.420
We're traitors to the Zhang Clan,

14:45.870 --> 14:47.330
and our faces bear the mark.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.570
Who you are doesn't matter.

14:56.840 --> 14:58.090
Because I won't let you

14:58.110 --> 14:58.900
leave here alive!

15:14.510 --> 15:16.210
You hurt my master's wife.

15:16.840 --> 15:18.420
Every one of you will die!

15:34.960 --> 15:35.660
Eryue Hong!

15:36.870 --> 15:38.060
Why did you disable the mechanism?

15:40.470 --> 15:41.540
I don't need you to save me.

15:43.710 --> 15:44.780
Isn't it a little late

15:44.990 --> 15:46.180
to pretend you care now?

15:59.440 --> 16:00.090
Eryue Hong!

16:01.870 --> 16:02.570
Eryue Hong!

16:16.110 --> 16:17.060
Chen Pi,

16:17.560 --> 16:18.730
you did well.

16:58.630 --> 16:59.180
Yatou,

17:01.680 --> 17:02.690
I'm sorry you had to suffer.

17:36.710 --> 17:38.540
Xie Jiu is the brains of the Mystic Nine.

17:39.230 --> 17:40.900
Ever since he returned from Beiping,

17:40.920 --> 17:42.370
his health has kept deteriorating.

17:42.710 --> 17:44.610
Now he relies on morphine just to stay alive.

17:44.870 --> 17:46.210
He's already finished.

17:47.510 --> 17:48.090
Ninth Master!

17:48.560 --> 17:49.020
Quick!

17:49.960 --> 17:50.330
Quick!

17:50.680 --> 17:51.140
Get him inside!

17:51.140 --> 17:55.500
[Resuscitation Room]

18:16.500 --> 18:17.280
[Good and Evil]

18:17.280 --> 18:18.450
As for Banjie Li,

18:19.590 --> 18:21.020
though he's only half a man now...

18:21.110 --> 18:21.610
San'er.

18:21.840 --> 18:24.020
His eyes and ears are all over Changsha.

18:24.560 --> 18:25.780
But he has a weakness too:

18:26.280 --> 18:28.090
his sister-in-law and son.

18:28.390 --> 18:29.090
Third Master!

18:29.750 --> 18:30.260
Chunhua!

18:30.800 --> 18:31.370
Don't move.

18:33.710 --> 18:35.260
If you don't want her ending up like you,

18:35.630 --> 18:36.610
put your blade away.

18:49.350 --> 18:49.850
Tell me.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.140
What do you want?

18:54.590 --> 18:55.330
Kneel.

18:57.390 --> 18:58.330
Crawl over here.

19:13.630 --> 19:14.210
Third Master!

19:16.230 --> 19:17.090
Don't do anything foolish.

19:18.320 --> 19:19.060
It took you so much

19:19.080 --> 19:20.300
to get where you are today.

19:20.870 --> 19:22.140
Don't you understand that?

19:23.840 --> 19:24.820
Let them kill me.

19:25.680 --> 19:26.370
Once I'm dead,

19:26.990 --> 19:28.210
they can't threaten you anymore.

19:42.320 --> 19:43.140
Third Master!

19:54.990 --> 19:55.690
Heibei

19:55.920 --> 19:57.610
is the strongest fighter in the Mystic Nine.

19:58.080 --> 19:59.490
Capturing him alive

19:59.510 --> 20:00.820
would normally take some effort.

20:01.320 --> 20:03.420
But now he has a weakness too.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.370
Heibei,

20:04.960 --> 20:05.690
leave me.

20:06.160 --> 20:06.610
Go.

20:06.800 --> 20:07.490
Go!

20:27.390 --> 20:28.210
Your life

20:28.870 --> 20:29.900
belongs to me.

20:32.920 --> 20:33.660
Let's go.

20:34.470 --> 20:35.370
Let's leave Changsha

20:36.040 --> 20:37.330
and leave all this trouble behind.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.540
Look out!

21:33.150 --> 21:34.740
You were hit by our Xiangxi poison needle,

21:34.910 --> 21:36.260
and you're still holding on?

21:36.870 --> 21:38.540
You killed so many of my men.

21:39.590 --> 21:41.650
Your woman can die with them!

21:41.800 --> 21:42.820
Don't you dare!

21:43.390 --> 21:44.020
Heibei,

21:44.840 --> 21:45.850
do you remember

21:46.720 --> 21:48.260
when I used to comb your hair?

21:49.040 --> 21:49.890
You said

21:51.430 --> 21:52.850
my bones were the hardest

21:54.190 --> 21:56.820
and perfect for a dagger handle.

22:20.080 --> 22:20.740
Heibei.

22:21.280 --> 22:22.500
Have you lost your mind?

22:23.800 --> 22:24.570
Didn't you say

22:25.560 --> 22:27.460
you only respected women who weren't afraid to die?

22:32.910 --> 22:33.410
Heibei!

22:33.760 --> 22:36.090
Let go!

22:37.720 --> 22:38.460
Let go!

22:41.040 --> 22:41.570
Heibei.

22:42.000 --> 22:42.820
Heibei!

22:43.760 --> 22:44.780
Heibei!

23:05.480 --> 23:08.170
This Xiangxi poison really is potent.

23:17.040 --> 23:17.780
Huo Wenhai,

23:18.870 --> 23:19.370
what...

23:20.000 --> 23:20.980
what do you want?

23:24.000 --> 23:24.850
You've got some nerve.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.500
How dare you call me by my name?

23:32.480 --> 23:33.610
I'm here to save you.

23:34.670 --> 23:35.780
The Mystic Nine are finished.

23:36.520 --> 23:37.930
I'm a member of the Huo Clan after all.

23:38.110 --> 23:39.410
I can't just stand by

23:39.430 --> 23:40.890
and watch my clan get dragged down by the scum

23:40.910 --> 23:41.610
from the other clans.

23:42.040 --> 23:42.780
From today on,

23:42.800 --> 23:43.980
I'm in charge of the Huo Clan.

23:44.720 --> 23:46.300
You're no longer part of the Mystic Nine either.

23:47.000 --> 23:47.890
Is that clear?

23:51.080 --> 23:51.850
What a pity.

23:52.520 --> 23:53.500
Xiangu isn't here today.

23:54.520 --> 23:55.500
I'll give you some time

23:57.280 --> 23:58.540
to think carefully

23:59.670 --> 24:00.740
about who you'll be loyal to

24:01.520 --> 24:02.570
from now on.

24:22.540 --> 24:25.420
[Chaozong Gate]

24:26.280 --> 24:27.220
What's going on?

24:29.080 --> 24:29.890
Are we going to war?

24:31.280 --> 24:31.740
Master Zhang,

24:32.630 --> 24:33.330
those on the tower

24:33.350 --> 24:34.130
don't look like our men.

24:34.430 --> 24:35.300
I'll go find out.

24:35.670 --> 24:36.220
Master Zhang.

24:36.950 --> 24:37.460
Master Zhang!

24:48.080 --> 24:48.540
Master Zhang,

24:48.870 --> 24:49.820
you're finally back.

24:50.000 --> 24:50.740
Xiaojin?

24:51.520 --> 24:52.370
What happened?

24:53.560 --> 24:54.460
Has the city been sealed?

24:55.280 --> 24:55.740
Yes.

24:56.670 --> 24:57.370
Orders came from above

24:57.840 --> 24:59.460
to eradicate a cult.

24:59.870 --> 25:00.610
A cult?

25:01.630 --> 25:02.980
What cult is there in Changsha?

25:11.280 --> 25:11.930
Officer Xiaojin.

25:13.520 --> 25:14.130
I looked into it.

25:14.800 --> 25:15.570
The Honghua Sect

25:15.800 --> 25:16.780
is a cult that appeared

25:16.800 --> 25:17.890
along the Xiang River a year ago.

25:18.590 --> 25:19.650
It was dealt with then.

25:20.000 --> 25:20.650
But for some reason,

25:20.870 --> 25:22.500
it suddenly appeared in Changsha.

25:23.150 --> 25:24.090
It does seem off.

25:24.950 --> 25:26.260
From appointing an acting Defense Commander

25:26.670 --> 25:27.740
to sealing the city and imposing a curfew,

25:27.910 --> 25:28.890
it took less than a day.

25:29.560 --> 25:30.330
That's way too fast.

25:31.150 --> 25:32.330
How are the other clans of the Mystic Nine?

25:32.480 --> 25:33.460
As instructed, we went

25:33.910 --> 25:35.500
to the residences of Second, Third,

25:35.590 --> 25:36.170
and Ninth Masters,

25:36.480 --> 25:37.460
but none of them was home.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.930
We were told that Ninth Master

25:40.760 --> 25:42.020
went to the Ministry of War

25:42.190 --> 25:43.570
to help investigate some bandit trouble,

25:44.430 --> 25:45.650
and that Third Master went there

25:45.840 --> 25:47.130
to assist with the Otherworld Tower investigation.

25:48.040 --> 25:48.610
As for Second Master,

25:49.840 --> 25:50.780
something's not right.

25:51.180 --> 25:53.340
[Pear Garden, Closed]

25:53.350 --> 25:55.410
It's said a senior official invited him to perform,

25:55.840 --> 25:56.980
and he won't be back for a few days.

25:59.000 --> 25:59.740
Closed?

26:01.560 --> 26:02.220
Anyone there?

26:14.190 --> 26:14.650
Master Zhang,

26:15.240 --> 26:16.410
they're not eradicating a cult.

26:16.910 --> 26:18.500
They're coming after the Mystic Nine.

26:18.910 --> 26:19.540
Huo Wenhai

26:19.950 --> 26:20.930
must be

26:20.950 --> 26:21.570
behind this.

26:23.350 --> 26:24.020
Huo Wenhai?

26:25.150 --> 26:26.300
Has something happened to the Huo Clan?

26:27.150 --> 26:28.330
The Huo Clan's women are still there.

26:28.840 --> 26:29.890
Maybe he spared them

26:30.000 --> 26:30.890
for old times' sake.

26:31.000 --> 26:31.700
But the Huo residence

26:32.040 --> 26:32.850
is already under his control.

26:36.560 --> 26:37.610
Huo Wenhai has long wanted

26:37.630 --> 26:38.780
to destroy the Mystic Nine.

26:39.430 --> 26:40.930
Now, with all this going on,

26:42.760 --> 26:43.260
could it be...?

26:43.800 --> 26:44.820
If he's really behind this,

26:46.320 --> 26:47.090
I'm afraid they're

26:47.110 --> 26:47.850
in grave danger.

26:48.800 --> 26:49.410
Back then, to stop

26:49.430 --> 26:50.650
his own mother from remarrying,

26:50.870 --> 26:52.170
he even slashed her face.

26:53.240 --> 26:54.460
If a man like that gets his way,

26:54.590 --> 26:55.700
he won't leave anyone alive.

26:56.280 --> 26:57.170
Who issued the order

26:57.320 --> 26:57.890
to seal the city?

26:58.320 --> 26:59.260
It came from the Special Commission Office

26:59.590 --> 27:00.540
through military command channels.

27:01.040 --> 27:01.820
All the paperwork is in order.

27:02.870 --> 27:04.460
So it really was ordered by the Ministry of War.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.500
This is bad.

27:05.560 --> 27:06.060
Master Zhang,

27:06.520 --> 27:07.330
the Mystic Nine

27:07.430 --> 27:08.820
may not survive this.

27:09.870 --> 27:10.700
If the Ministry of War

27:10.720 --> 27:12.500
had really ordered a purge of the Mystic Nine,

27:13.350 --> 27:15.020
they could've openly sent troops.

27:15.670 --> 27:16.570
There would've been no need

27:16.670 --> 27:17.500
to suppress the news,

27:18.110 --> 27:19.540
much less fabricate

27:20.040 --> 27:21.060
some absurd excuse

27:21.590 --> 27:22.610
about eradicating a cult.

27:23.390 --> 27:24.700
If the reason is false,

27:25.430 --> 27:26.570
it means this whole affair

27:26.950 --> 27:27.740
can't be made public.

27:27.910 --> 27:28.890
The Ministry of War

27:29.870 --> 27:31.220
must not have enough evidence

27:31.240 --> 27:32.130
to convict the Mystic Nine.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.930
If Huo Wenhai is truly moving

27:34.950 --> 27:35.820
against the Mystic Nine,

27:37.390 --> 27:38.820
he won't dare kill anyone.

27:40.040 --> 27:41.410
He'd be afraid of causing too much trouble.

27:41.840 --> 27:42.740
Then the Ministry of War

27:42.760 --> 27:43.740
would deny everything

27:44.430 --> 27:46.540
and dismiss him first.

27:47.390 --> 27:48.370
Good point, Master Zhang.

27:49.280 --> 27:50.330
What Huo Wenhai fears most

27:50.630 --> 27:51.700
is losing his uniform.

27:52.190 --> 27:53.410
Without that status,

27:53.870 --> 27:54.540
in the Huo Clan,

27:55.000 --> 27:55.850
he'd be worth less than a dog.

27:56.350 --> 27:57.330
But each of the Mystic Nine's leaders

27:57.480 --> 27:58.370
is a tough opponent.

27:58.720 --> 27:59.850
How could someone like Huo Wenhai

28:00.480 --> 28:01.610
possibly take them down?

28:02.280 --> 28:02.740
Exactly.

28:03.390 --> 28:04.740
That's also what baffles me.

28:05.360 --> 28:06.660
He must've used

28:06.680 --> 28:07.540
some underhanded trick.

28:08.430 --> 28:08.980
Otherwise,

28:09.950 --> 28:10.740
even if they deployed

28:10.760 --> 28:11.610
an entire battalion,

28:12.190 --> 28:13.610
any clan leader of the Mystic Nine

28:13.760 --> 28:14.930
could escape without much trouble.

28:16.760 --> 28:17.330
Master Zhang,

28:17.950 --> 28:18.610
I think

28:19.110 --> 28:21.060
we should stay out of sight for now.

28:21.480 --> 28:22.980
It won't be too late

28:23.000 --> 28:23.650
if we

28:24.080 --> 28:25.130
get the full picture first

28:25.590 --> 28:26.460
and then decide what to do.

28:26.720 --> 28:27.300
Right?

28:27.520 --> 28:28.220
I can't leave.

28:29.390 --> 28:30.500
This concerns the Mystic Nine.

28:31.630 --> 28:32.780
I'm the head of the Mystic Nine.

28:33.760 --> 28:34.980
I can't just walk away.

28:36.350 --> 28:37.060
Besides, Huo Wenhai

28:37.080 --> 28:38.540
must have men watching the roads.

28:39.560 --> 28:40.820
He probably already knows

28:41.480 --> 28:42.570
we've returned to Changsha.

28:43.760 --> 28:45.410
If I leave now, it'll look

28:45.950 --> 28:47.020
like I'm fleeing out of guilt.

28:47.560 --> 28:48.780
So I have to go back into the city.

28:50.240 --> 28:50.980
I need to settle this

28:51.870 --> 28:53.130
with him in person.

28:54.390 --> 28:54.980
Xiaoyu, Xiaojin.

28:55.080 --> 28:55.460
Yes.

28:55.950 --> 28:57.060
Call back as many guards

28:57.350 --> 28:58.130
as you can.

28:58.630 --> 28:59.700
If the situation changes,

29:00.520 --> 29:01.540
be ready to respond.

29:01.840 --> 29:02.500
- Yes. - Yes.

29:02.840 --> 29:03.890
Laogou, Xiangu,

29:04.390 --> 29:04.850
Tiezui,

29:05.870 --> 29:06.980
find somewhere safe

29:07.000 --> 29:07.650
and settle in.

29:08.000 --> 29:08.650
Don't return to the city yet.

29:09.040 --> 29:09.500
No.

29:10.040 --> 29:10.780
I can assist you.

29:11.480 --> 29:13.090
You have something more important to do.

29:13.800 --> 29:15.090
Contact every newspaper

29:15.190 --> 29:16.020
and news agency you can.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.610
Spread the word.

29:18.320 --> 29:19.260
Create public pressure

29:19.870 --> 29:20.740
so Huo Wenhai

29:20.760 --> 29:21.980
has no choice but to bring

29:22.480 --> 29:23.500
the whole affair into the open.

29:24.080 --> 29:24.740
Then

29:25.190 --> 29:26.740
he'll have to play his hand openly.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.300
Rest assured.

29:29.560 --> 29:30.300
I'll take care of this.

29:31.630 --> 29:32.610
Let's split up.

29:34.080 --> 29:35.460
Where is Huo Wenhai now?

29:36.000 --> 29:36.500
Master Zhang,

29:37.320 --> 29:37.930
he...

29:39.870 --> 29:40.820
he's at our residence.

29:42.240 --> 29:42.740
I'm sorry.

29:42.840 --> 29:43.850
I couldn't stop him.

29:44.480 --> 29:45.890
He got a requisition order from above

29:46.150 --> 29:47.220
to turn the Zhang residence

29:47.240 --> 29:48.570
into some kind of martial-law command.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.410
He's inside right now.

29:51.520 --> 29:52.530
Looks like he really thinks

29:52.550 --> 29:53.820
he has every advantage

29:53.840 --> 29:54.620
and can take me down.

29:56.070 --> 29:57.050
I'd like to see

29:58.120 --> 29:59.460
just what he can possibly do.

30:12.100 --> 30:15.380
[Grocery Store]

30:16.760 --> 30:17.170
Come on.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.130
Take this.

30:22.280 --> 30:23.020
Will this really work?

30:23.390 --> 30:24.740
Changsha is under martial law.

30:25.190 --> 30:26.570
Ordinary people can't even be out on the streets.

30:27.630 --> 30:28.820
We have to pose as porters

30:28.840 --> 30:30.410
delivering supplies to the barracks.

30:31.240 --> 30:31.930
I've looked into it.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.090
Most of our men

30:33.240 --> 30:34.260
have gone over there.

30:36.350 --> 30:36.850
Wait.

30:38.190 --> 30:39.020
Isn't that mask

30:39.800 --> 30:41.220
a little too conspicuous?

30:43.620 --> 30:46.150
[Doghead Brand]

30:46.150 --> 30:46.740
Stop!

30:50.280 --> 30:50.850
Sir,

30:51.430 --> 30:52.570
we're delivering supplies.

30:52.910 --> 30:53.610
Show me your pass.

30:59.180 --> 31:01.260
[Pass]

31:08.000 --> 31:08.540
Sir,

31:09.000 --> 31:09.890
he's caught a chill.

31:15.910 --> 31:16.410
Go on.

31:16.480 --> 31:16.820
Come on.

31:20.320 --> 31:20.740
Move.

31:30.780 --> 31:32.580
[Changsha Temporary Martial-Law Command]

32:34.350 --> 32:35.330
Master Zhang,

32:36.720 --> 32:37.780
after traveling all this way,

32:37.840 --> 32:38.700
you must be exhausted.

32:39.670 --> 32:40.500
It's time

32:40.800 --> 32:42.020
you got some proper rest.

32:42.390 --> 32:43.780
Who gave you the right to redeploy

32:43.800 --> 32:44.780
my Zhang Clan guards?

32:45.560 --> 32:46.540
And you've turned

32:47.280 --> 32:48.410
my residence into Changsha's

32:48.430 --> 32:49.330
temporary martial-law command.

32:49.800 --> 32:50.540
What are you trying to do?

32:54.760 --> 32:55.650
At a time like this,

32:55.670 --> 32:56.700
you're still lecturing me

32:56.720 --> 32:58.060
about military rules?

33:00.280 --> 33:01.820
The higher-ups want the Mystic Nine wiped out.

33:03.630 --> 33:04.610
I'm only following orders,

33:05.320 --> 33:06.570
suppressing bandits

33:07.240 --> 33:08.330
and defending the nation.

33:08.350 --> 33:09.650
But you, Zhang Qishan,

33:10.320 --> 33:12.020
have held power in the Mystic Nine for years

33:12.670 --> 33:13.650
and consorted with criminals.

33:14.430 --> 33:16.130
Can you still tell public duty from private interest,

33:16.190 --> 33:17.540
or country from family?

33:18.670 --> 33:19.570
Unless you're eliminated,

33:21.040 --> 33:22.570
the Mystic Nine can never be uprooted.

33:25.950 --> 33:26.780
Are you sure

33:29.800 --> 33:31.330
you can eliminate me today?

33:31.590 --> 33:32.650
Of course I know

33:32.670 --> 33:33.820
what you're capable of.

33:35.350 --> 33:36.540
Otherwise, I wouldn't have

33:38.390 --> 33:40.020
held back all these years.

33:40.800 --> 33:41.930
But some things

33:45.630 --> 33:46.820
take more than good timing.

33:48.280 --> 33:49.020
Zhang Qishan,

33:50.720 --> 33:51.740
this day next year

33:53.240 --> 33:54.570
will be the anniversary of your death!

36:04.040 --> 36:04.740
Stop!

36:32.480 --> 36:33.060
Sir.

36:33.800 --> 36:34.460
Huo Wenhai,

36:36.040 --> 36:37.410
you're an officer of the National Revolutionary Army,

36:38.430 --> 36:39.570
not some street thug!

36:41.630 --> 36:42.410
If you still remember

36:42.430 --> 36:43.260
who you are,

36:45.950 --> 36:47.300
put aside your personal grudges

36:47.320 --> 36:48.610
with Zhang Qishan and the Mystic Nine.

36:56.190 --> 36:57.220
Just because he interfered

36:57.240 --> 36:58.130
in Xie Jiu's case,

37:00.870 --> 37:02.460
you've held a grudge against him

37:03.080 --> 37:05.540
and come to his own residence looking for trouble?

37:06.630 --> 37:08.330
If I hadn't arrived in time today,

37:09.000 --> 37:09.980
he could've charged you

37:10.320 --> 37:11.220
with trying to murder an ally

37:11.720 --> 37:12.570
and violating military discipline.

37:13.240 --> 37:14.610
You'd never be able to clear your name!

37:16.520 --> 37:17.170
You're

37:18.840 --> 37:19.740
still too young

37:20.350 --> 37:21.410
and far too arrogant.

37:22.430 --> 37:23.650
Go back and write me a proper self-criticism!

37:25.430 --> 37:25.850
Sir...

37:25.950 --> 37:26.330
What?

37:27.080 --> 37:27.850
Have I wronged you?

37:30.190 --> 37:30.980
If you have something to say,

37:31.760 --> 37:32.610
say it now.

37:33.590 --> 37:33.980
No, sir.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.410
One more thing.

37:43.720 --> 37:45.780
This is the residence of the Changsha Defense Commander.

37:46.480 --> 37:47.650
Give it back to Qishan.

37:48.910 --> 37:51.060
Get everyone and everything

37:51.870 --> 37:53.410
back to wherever they came from!

37:53.950 --> 37:54.460
Now!

37:55.390 --> 37:55.850
Yes, sir!

37:56.560 --> 37:57.020
Move out!

38:16.000 --> 38:16.790
Master Zhang?

38:17.600 --> 38:18.260
Qishan,

38:19.920 --> 38:21.420
these two adjutants of yours

38:21.720 --> 38:22.690
are quite a handful.

38:23.870 --> 38:25.300
They were running around the barracks

38:25.320 --> 38:26.180
in civilian clothes.

38:26.760 --> 38:28.010
They violated martial law regulations

38:33.120 --> 38:34.410
and even forged transfer orders.

38:36.800 --> 38:37.780
I've brought them along.

38:39.470 --> 38:41.410
You'd better discipline them properly.

38:45.030 --> 38:45.820
Thank you, sir.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.530
They'll be properly disciplined.

38:49.280 --> 38:50.220
I came today to discuss

38:50.800 --> 38:52.010
something very important

38:52.030 --> 38:52.780
with you.

38:53.800 --> 38:54.410
If there's

38:55.550 --> 38:56.620
anything you want to do,

38:56.990 --> 38:57.930
do it now.

38:58.600 --> 39:00.010
Because I'm afraid

39:00.870 --> 39:01.490
that after we talk,

39:02.350 --> 39:03.490
you may not get the chance.

39:14.320 --> 39:14.820
Master Zhang.

39:23.470 --> 39:24.490
If I hadn't arrived,

39:25.160 --> 39:26.370
you'd probably be dead now.

39:27.950 --> 39:29.100
You don't have what it takes,

39:29.390 --> 39:30.740
yet you went after Zhang Qishan.

39:31.910 --> 39:32.970
I only wanted to do away

39:32.990 --> 39:34.530
with the Mystic Nine as soon as possible.

39:35.320 --> 39:37.220
Zhang Qishan is too deeply tied to them.

39:37.680 --> 39:38.330
As long as he's around,

39:38.680 --> 39:40.140
it'll be difficult to make moves.

39:41.680 --> 39:43.780
I never really intended to harm him.

39:43.800 --> 39:44.530
I only wanted

39:45.160 --> 39:46.660
to keep him from interfering for a while.

39:50.870 --> 39:52.010
Didn't you say the leaders

39:52.600 --> 39:53.850
of the Mystic Nine couldn't be killed?

39:53.870 --> 39:55.220
That's why I've held Eryue Hong,

39:55.240 --> 39:55.850
Banjie Li,

39:55.870 --> 39:57.050
Heibei Laoliu, and Xie Jiu

39:57.070 --> 39:57.890
in custody for now.

39:59.280 --> 40:00.410
I did exactly as you instructed

40:00.430 --> 40:01.660
and never overstepped in the slightest.

40:02.120 --> 40:03.050
As I instructed?

40:05.120 --> 40:06.740
You deliberately twisted the orders from above

40:07.390 --> 40:08.660
to serve your own ends.

40:09.640 --> 40:10.300
Huo Wenhai,

40:10.550 --> 40:11.890
that's a grave taboo in the Ministry of War.

40:12.390 --> 40:13.220
Do you think

40:13.240 --> 40:14.490
the officials there are fools

40:15.160 --> 40:16.410
who can't see through your little schemes?

40:17.280 --> 40:18.330
I would never dare.

40:18.390 --> 40:19.930
I only wanted to ease your burden.

40:19.950 --> 40:20.410
I just...

40:22.160 --> 40:23.260
I failed to think things through

40:23.470 --> 40:24.330
and acted rashly.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.260
Please forgive me, sir.

40:29.280 --> 40:30.620
You want to ease my burden

40:31.600 --> 40:33.300
and resolve the Ministry of War's concerns?

40:34.470 --> 40:35.490
Then why

40:35.760 --> 40:36.890
is the Huo Clan exempt?

40:38.160 --> 40:39.490
What will the higher-ups think?

40:43.640 --> 40:45.740
I'm loyal only to the Ministry of War.

40:47.240 --> 40:48.050
With the Mystic Nine around,

40:48.160 --> 40:49.300
Changsha will never know peace.

40:50.430 --> 40:51.740
Since the Huo Clan is part of the Mystic Nine,

40:52.030 --> 40:52.820
it should be purged as well.

40:54.800 --> 40:55.660
I'll handle it myself

40:57.120 --> 40:58.050
and show no favoritism.

41:01.510 --> 41:02.530
I'm partly to blame.

41:02.950 --> 41:04.740
When I gave you the order,

41:04.950 --> 41:05.970
I wasn't clear enough.

41:06.840 --> 41:08.140
But military orders are absolute.

41:08.950 --> 41:10.820
Now that the purge of the Mystic Nine

41:11.390 --> 41:12.300
has begun,

41:13.840 --> 41:15.620
we can't reverse course overnight.

41:15.910 --> 41:17.450
Besides, the higher-ups already know.

41:18.950 --> 41:20.450
If you're going to do it, do it cleanly.

41:21.240 --> 41:22.410
Don't leave any loose ends.

41:22.990 --> 41:23.700
Otherwise,

41:23.800 --> 41:24.930
there will be severe consequences.

41:29.020 --> 41:30.620
[Xinyue Restaurant]

41:35.420 --> 41:40.060
[Lumen Grand Theatre]

41:41.820 --> 41:43.120
[Sealed by the Military Affairs Commission]

41:43.120 --> 41:43.700
Sir,

41:44.160 --> 41:45.410
all the shops along the street

41:45.510 --> 41:46.370
have been sealed off,

41:46.800 --> 41:48.050
including Xinyue Restaurant.

41:49.120 --> 41:49.620
Father,

41:50.120 --> 41:50.850
haven't the authorities

41:50.870 --> 41:51.970
always treated us well?

41:52.280 --> 41:53.530
Why have they turned against us?

41:54.320 --> 41:55.100
Don't we have an agreement

41:55.120 --> 41:56.140
with those at the very top?

41:57.070 --> 41:58.820
A storm is brewing.

42:00.120 --> 42:01.660
It seems

42:01.680 --> 42:02.890
a major war is coming.

42:03.870 --> 42:05.180
We need to be prepared as well.

42:05.550 --> 42:06.410
Tell everyone

42:06.680 --> 42:08.140
that all auctions are indefinitely suspended.

42:08.280 --> 42:09.620
Move everything into Warehouse 11.

42:11.910 --> 42:12.700
Go to the telegraph office.

42:13.240 --> 42:14.330
I'm sending Zhang Qishan a telegram.

42:14.390 --> 42:14.970
Yes, sir.

42:31.070 --> 42:31.490
Master Zhang,

42:32.070 --> 42:32.820
a telegram from Mr. Yin.

42:33.400 --> 42:33.970
Read it.

42:34.470 --> 42:35.300
This is urgent.

42:35.680 --> 42:36.580
You'd better read it yourself.

42:42.870 --> 42:45.220
Xinyue Restaurant and all Yin family properties

42:45.470 --> 42:46.930
have been seized by the Ministry of War.

42:47.600 --> 42:49.260
The telephone at the residence is also being monitored.

42:50.760 --> 42:52.010
I've learned what happened in Beiping.

42:53.030 --> 42:55.010
Are you and Xinyue safe?

42:56.990 --> 42:57.850
Changsha has fallen into chaos.

42:58.840 --> 42:59.740
Many of the Mystic Nine

43:00.160 --> 43:01.490
are in Huo Wenhai's hands.

43:02.600 --> 43:03.450
The situation is urgent.

43:04.430 --> 43:05.410
I can't get away.

43:09.700 --> 43:12.260
[Taiho Telegraph Office]

43:28.640 --> 43:29.100
Father,

43:29.720 --> 43:30.530
how is he?

43:37.120 --> 43:38.300
Safe for now, it seems.

43:46.120 --> 43:46.620
Father,

43:47.550 --> 43:49.100
what do you make

43:49.430 --> 43:50.450
of the situation in Changsha?

43:51.680 --> 43:52.580
The Mystic Nine

43:53.430 --> 43:55.180
are a force born among the people to resist

43:55.200 --> 43:56.330
warlords and aristocratic powers.

43:57.680 --> 43:58.660
They emerged naturally

43:58.680 --> 43:59.820
from troubled times.

44:00.680 --> 44:02.370
But now, our country

44:02.800 --> 44:05.100
is about to be tested by war.

44:05.990 --> 44:07.180
Before long,

44:07.950 --> 44:09.780
you'll see a new world.

44:10.720 --> 44:12.490
When that world comes,

44:13.240 --> 44:13.970
perhaps people

44:15.200 --> 44:16.820
will no longer need the Mystic Nine.

44:20.030 --> 44:20.740
I understand.

44:21.910 --> 44:23.330
The Mystic Nine may be

44:23.990 --> 44:25.740
a ship built on honor and justice,

44:27.550 --> 44:28.450
but it can

44:28.470 --> 44:29.490
no longer sail on.

44:30.160 --> 44:30.780
Exactly.

44:32.160 --> 44:33.100
The problem

44:33.120 --> 44:34.490
the Mystic Nine face isn't Huo Wenhai.

44:34.640 --> 44:35.930
Nor is it the Ministry of War.

44:37.070 --> 44:38.660
It has fulfilled its purpose.

44:39.070 --> 44:39.890
In the future,

44:40.550 --> 44:42.010
people will no longer accept it.

44:43.200 --> 44:44.330
So whether Zhang Qishan

44:44.910 --> 44:45.850
stays

44:45.870 --> 44:47.010
aboard that old ship

44:48.030 --> 44:49.700
or steps into the new world

44:51.160 --> 44:52.660
is entirely up to him.

44:57.240 --> 44:57.820
I know.

45:01.550 --> 45:02.530
As husband and wife, we stand as one.

45:03.430 --> 45:05.330
I know he's not a man bound by the old ways.

45:09.160 --> 45:10.850
I can't make the choice for him.

45:12.950 --> 45:14.330
Nor will I interfere.

45:23.720 --> 45:26.620
As the last of the Mystic Nine,

45:26.720 --> 45:29.140
the Xie Clan must maintain its order,

45:29.510 --> 45:30.700
keep the other clans in check,

45:30.840 --> 45:31.930
support whichever clan holds power,

45:32.070 --> 45:33.850
and keep the Mystic Nine on the right path

45:33.950 --> 45:34.970
without disturbing the people

45:35.280 --> 45:36.370
or the authorities,

45:36.600 --> 45:38.450
[Young Xie Jiu]
so peace may endure for generations.

45:38.600 --> 45:40.620
That is the duty of the Xie Clan.

45:40.720 --> 45:43.010
Then what are the Mystic Nine?

45:43.010 --> 45:44.030
[Elder of the Xie Clan]

45:44.030 --> 45:46.580
Why do they need to exist?

45:46.760 --> 45:49.010
When the authorities are unjust and the law falls short,

45:49.120 --> 45:50.740
martial brotherhoods throughout history

45:50.760 --> 45:52.110
have stepped in to right wrongs in trade,

45:52.240 --> 45:54.140
banding together to gather the people's strength

45:54.280 --> 45:55.450
and balance the strong against the weak.

45:57.320 --> 45:58.530
Then what

45:59.470 --> 46:00.780
will your name be?

46:01.240 --> 46:03.530
If I become the head of the clan,

46:03.680 --> 46:04.700
I'll take the name Jiu,
[*Jiu: nine]

46:04.760 --> 46:06.580
to guard the Mystic Nine and carry on its legacy.

46:07.680 --> 46:08.330
Good.

46:08.950 --> 46:09.660
Very good.

46:09.840 --> 46:10.970
The strength of the Mystic Nine

46:11.200 --> 46:12.930
lies with its top leader,

46:13.350 --> 46:14.580
who must be righteous and strong

46:14.640 --> 46:16.220
and never stray from the right path.

46:17.160 --> 46:19.850
The Xie Clan will shoulder the difficult deeds,

46:20.640 --> 46:21.820
bear the consequences ourselves,

46:22.120 --> 46:23.300
and act for the good of the people.

46:23.950 --> 46:25.780
That is the honor of the last of the Nine.

46:26.640 --> 46:28.410
What is the greatest duty of the Xie Clan?

46:29.160 --> 46:30.490
The Xie Clan must quietly maintain

46:30.510 --> 46:31.580
the order of the Mystic Nine.

46:31.840 --> 46:33.330
Whichever clan comes to power,

46:33.430 --> 46:35.410
whether it comes from high standing

46:35.430 --> 46:36.740
or humble origins,

46:36.870 --> 46:38.780
we must do all we can to support it

46:38.990 --> 46:40.530
and guide it onto the right path.

46:40.680 --> 46:42.850
Only then can the Mystic Nine endure for generations.

46:43.870 --> 46:45.260
And what matters most when assisting

46:45.870 --> 46:47.100
the other clans of the Mystic Nine?

46:47.510 --> 46:49.010
The foundation of the Mystic Nine

46:49.160 --> 46:50.300
lies with its top leader.

46:50.510 --> 46:51.890
He must be righteous and strong

46:52.120 --> 46:53.140
and never take the wrong path.

46:53.350 --> 46:54.450
As for the difficult things

46:54.510 --> 46:55.820
that still must be done,

46:55.870 --> 46:57.620
the Xie Clan will take them on.

46:58.070 --> 46:59.370
I will bear the consequences myself.

46:59.470 --> 47:00.850
As long as I can protect the Mystic Nine

47:00.950 --> 47:01.780
and serve the people,

47:02.070 --> 47:02.850
it will be worth it.

47:39.990 --> 47:41.530
Huo Wenhai acted on his own

47:42.120 --> 47:43.970
and arrested several clan leaders of the Mystic Nine.

47:48.600 --> 47:50.050
The higher-ups intend to turn a blind eye for now

47:50.840 --> 47:53.450
and let Huo Wenhai make an example of the Mystic Nine

47:53.870 --> 47:55.050
to warn the others.

47:56.070 --> 47:57.100
At noon tomorrow,

47:57.510 --> 47:58.660
you'll all be executed.

48:03.640 --> 48:04.530
The Ministry of War

48:04.720 --> 48:06.260
has raised itself quite a mad dog.

48:07.680 --> 48:08.970
To climb the ranks,

48:09.470 --> 48:10.890
there's nothing he won't do.

48:13.120 --> 48:13.780
Mr. Luo,

48:14.350 --> 48:15.930
the fate of the Mystic Nine is already sealed.

48:17.160 --> 48:18.140
What you care about more

48:19.550 --> 48:21.820
is whether Changsha can remain stable, isn't it?

48:22.910 --> 48:24.100
The moment we die,

48:25.600 --> 48:27.820
Changsha will descend into chaos.

48:32.200 --> 48:33.700
With the war intensifying,

48:34.470 --> 48:35.620
the situation is a mess.

48:36.910 --> 48:38.620
Zhang Qishan has troops under his command

48:38.720 --> 48:39.530
and knows how to fight.

48:39.840 --> 48:41.530
He's highly valued by the Ministry of War.

48:41.910 --> 48:43.140
They're keeping him for the front lines.

48:43.550 --> 48:44.620
As for the other clan leaders,

48:46.200 --> 48:47.450
if they're dealt with quickly,

48:48.240 --> 48:49.890
Changsha won't fall into chaos.

48:51.950 --> 48:54.010
You sounded so sincere before,

48:54.950 --> 48:55.890
but in the end,

48:55.910 --> 48:57.700
all you want is to keep Zhang Qishan.

48:59.240 --> 49:01.140
The Mystic Nine has stood for a century,

49:02.430 --> 49:03.580
but to you,

49:05.510 --> 49:08.700
it's just something to be cut away in one clean stroke.

49:08.760 --> 49:09.700
Circumstances leave us no choice.

49:10.200 --> 49:11.300
There's no room for sentiment.

49:12.600 --> 49:13.220
Mr. Xie,

49:14.280 --> 49:15.220
you understand better than I do

49:15.240 --> 49:16.450
what it means to consider the greater good.

49:16.950 --> 49:17.820
Besides, I gave you

49:17.870 --> 49:18.820
time and opportunity.

49:19.350 --> 49:20.740
And you promised me a solution too,

49:21.470 --> 49:22.010
didn't you?

49:25.550 --> 49:27.180
There is a way.

49:30.240 --> 49:32.100
Kill six and spare three.

49:33.950 --> 49:34.970
Among the Mystic Nine,

49:36.430 --> 49:37.300
the Zhang Clan,

49:38.160 --> 49:39.100
the Hong Clan,

49:39.910 --> 49:41.660
and the Huo Clan must be spared,

49:43.160 --> 49:44.850
or Changsha will fall into chaos.

49:45.760 --> 49:47.370
As for the other six,

49:49.720 --> 49:50.850
let Zhang Qishan

49:50.870 --> 49:52.180
eliminate them himself.

49:53.390 --> 49:55.220
Once the Mystic Nine lose their foundation,

49:55.510 --> 49:56.580
they'll never rise again.

49:56.990 --> 49:57.620
That way,

49:59.390 --> 50:00.930
your position will remain secure,

50:02.320 --> 50:04.300
the Mystic Nine will survive in name only,

50:06.720 --> 50:08.780
and Changsha will remain stable.

50:10.990 --> 50:12.010
Zhang Qishan

50:12.030 --> 50:12.970
values loyalty deeply.

50:15.470 --> 50:16.330
Are you sure he can

50:16.350 --> 50:17.300
bring himself to do it?

50:19.800 --> 50:20.970
If he can't,

50:22.760 --> 50:24.930
I'll force him to.

50:44.240 --> 50:46.530
When this candle goes out tonight,

50:49.760 --> 50:52.260
the Mystic Nine will enter a long night,

50:56.550 --> 50:57.890
Master Zhang.

51:18.740 --> 51:22.900
♪The past fades like smoke♪

51:23.260 --> 51:25.980
♪A choice is made in silence♪

51:26.260 --> 51:29.060
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

51:29.460 --> 51:33.220
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

51:33.460 --> 51:36.900
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

51:37.180 --> 51:40.580
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

51:40.660 --> 51:47.940
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

51:48.380 --> 51:51.660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

51:51.940 --> 51:55.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

51:55.340 --> 51:59.380
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

51:59.580 --> 52:02.940
♪Who believes in fate?♪

52:03.180 --> 52:06.540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

52:06.780 --> 52:10.060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

52:10.380 --> 52:14.060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

52:14.260 --> 52:17.500
♪Take care♪

52:17.500 --> 52:20.060
♪We once raced♪

52:20.140 --> 52:22.060
♪For the dawn♪

52:22.220 --> 52:25.500
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

52:25.620 --> 52:28.900
♪In the web of fate♪

52:28.900 --> 52:32.100
♪No one can escape♪

52:33.100 --> 52:34.940
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

52:35.100 --> 52:36.660
♪We too were young once♪

52:36.740 --> 52:40.180
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

52:40.380 --> 52:42.700
♪Keep the ember lit♪

52:42.820 --> 52:47.340
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

52:47.460 --> 52:50.420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

52:50.660 --> 52:54.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

52:54.300 --> 52:58.060
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

52:58.380 --> 53:01.860
♪Who believes in fate?♪

53:02.020 --> 53:05.020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

53:05.260 --> 53:09.020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

53:09.180 --> 53:12.900
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

53:13.020 --> 53:24.460
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
